{
  "name": "MAXXAM AI — Sheet Writer (Content Calendar)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -20,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MAXXAM AI — Sheet Writer\n\n**Purpose:** Receive pre-generated content from Claude and append it to the Content_Calendar Google Sheet.\n\n**No AI nodes. No Anthropic credential needed.**\n\n**ONE-TIME SETUP:**\n1. Open **Write to Content Calendar** node\n2. Replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` with your actual Sheet ID\n3. Activate this workflow\n4. Copy the webhook URL from the Sheet Writer Webhook node\n\n**How it works:**\n- Claude generates the LinkedIn post via the /maxxam-linkedin-content skill\n- You approve the post in Claude\n- Claude POSTs the JSON row to this webhook\n- This workflow validates the data and appends it to the sheet\n\n**Test payload:**\n```json\n{\n  \"id\": \"20260321-001\",\n  \"pillar\": \"3\",\n  \"pillar_name\": \"Healthcare Automation\",\n  \"platform\": \"LinkedIn\",\n  \"content_type\": \"text\",\n  \"topic\": \"No-show recovery for therapy practices\",\n  \"hook\": \"Test hook line\",\n  \"body\": \"Test body content\",\n  \"cta\": \"Book a call\",\n  \"scheduled_date\": \"2026-03-24\",\n  \"scheduled_time\": \"08:00\",\n  \"status\": \"approved\"\n}\n```",
        "width": 540,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sheet Writer Webhook",
      "webhookId": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "maxxam-sheet-writer",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Validate & Build Row",
      "notes": "Validates required fields and builds a clean Content_Calendar row. No AI required.",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate required fields and build a clean Content_Calendar row\ntry {\n  const body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\n\n  if (!body.topic) throw new Error('Missing required field: topic');\n  if (!body.platform) throw new Error('Missing required field: platform');\n\n  const today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\n  const id = body.id || today.replace(/-/g, '') + '-' + Math.floor(Math.random() * 900 + 100);\n\n  const pillarNames = {\n    '1': 'AI Automation Systems & Processes',\n    '2': 'Success Stories & Case Studies',\n    '3': 'Healthcare Automation',\n    '4': 'AI Myths & Misconceptions',\n    '5': 'Industry Insights',\n    '6': 'Q&A & Concerns',\n    '7': 'Behind-the-Scenes & Personal'\n  };\n\n  const pillar = String(body.pillar || '1');\n\n  return [{\n    json: {\n      id,\n      pillar,\n      pillar_name: body.pillar_name || pillarNames[pillar] || 'AI Automation Systems & Processes',\n      platform: body.platform || 'LinkedIn',\n      content_type: body.content_type || 'text',\n      topic: body.topic,\n      hook: body.hook || '',\n      body: body.body || '',\n      cta: body.cta || 'Book a discovery call: https://cal.com/reginald-johnson-fphjbi/discovery',\n      image_url: body.image_url || '',\n      scheduled_date: body.scheduled_date || today,\n      scheduled_time: body.scheduled_time || '08:00',\n      status: body.status || 'draft',\n      posted_at: '',\n      post_url: '',\n      impressions: '',\n      engagement: '',\n      notes: body.notes || 'Added via Sheet Writer webhook'\n    }\n  }];\n} catch (error) {\n  console.error('Validate & Build Row:', error.message);\n  throw new Error('Validation failed: ' + error.message);\n}"
      }
    },
